    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/445160-1.JPG\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 119px;\" /><br /><br /><br />Between the inner shell and outer shell, the capacitance of the system is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>AB</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>πε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>ab</mi></mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>Between the outer shell and infinity</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>∞</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>πε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>total</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>πε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>ab</mi></mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>πε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math></p>",
